abstract: "Code, results and traceability files for a leave-one-attack-out evaluation of three sequence models (TRACE-MoE, a Transformer and a BiLSTM-DNN), energy-based and feature-space scores for unseen-attack detection on the Wi-Fi and MQTT subset of CICIoMT2024: five held-out attack classes, five seeds, 75 runs."
